  "summary": "Malicious code in @sqlite-table/schema-generator (npm)",
  "details": "On require(), index.js fetches a remote payload from hxxps://api[.]github[.]com/gists/b57a92378ad0a52430137c3b810e7107 (a GitHub gist under the account \"getchainverse\") and executes it via eval(). At runtime the payload attempted DNS resolution to a C2 endpoint. The package has no lifecycle hooks — the malicious code runs when the module is imported, not at install time.",
